# (AI-assisted) the Zoomer: Fire Canyon, Lava Tube and the Mountain Pass race (all tasks closed,
# 100 cells: every Zoomer pad is unlocked). Jak is put next to the Zoomer, Circle until he rides
# it (a first-time Keira cutscene plays first), then X held (accelerate) with steering.
#   OPENGOAL_NO_SOUND=1 OPENGOAL_PAD_SCRIPT=<this file> build-host-small/game/gk --proj-path <proj>
#     --config-path <scratch dir> --ctr-gfx -- -boot -fakeiso -nosound -cbackend
# Format and commands: game/sce/pad_script.h
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
150 tasks 2 111
160 call poke32 $*game-info* 92 f100
200 log SEG firecanyon-start
200 continue firecanyon-start
201 wait *target* target-continue
440 pstate racer
441 teleport racer 0 2
